        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9130/30, Solid Brass Sunflower Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cheery cabinet knob is sure to brighten up any home. From the sunflower in the knob to the ridges along the handle, every detail adds a charming rural accent. This pull is not just for kitchen cabinets ether. Try using it in the bathroom or on sliding accordion closet doors too! The sunflower cabinet knob is solid brass construction regardless of outside finish you choose.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Similar design <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Omnia Decorative Cabinet Knobs</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n <p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Flower Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LCN-4041T-size.gif?v=1704354722\" width=\"342\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n</p>",
